<title>ARGENTINA: YPF raises qtly dividend to $0.22 from $0.20.</title>
<headline>YPF raises qtly dividend to $0.22 from $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine oil company raised its quarterly dividend to $0.22 from $0.20.</p>
<p>YPF announced its quarterly dividend was of $0.22 in the year closed December 31, and a Buenos Aires Stock Exchange official said the previous year quarterly dividend was $0.20. ((-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
